                                                "sense_id": "ebf0e235-9644-3ad7-8898-5d3e51ee96f2",
                                                "text": "As I live, these covered parts of him were checkered with the same squares as his face; his back, too, was all over the same dark squares; he seemed to have been in a Thirty Years’ War, and just escaped from it with a sticking-plaster shirt."
                                            }
