                                                "sense_id": "c9bf80a6-c2a3-3c61-b84d-13c1b009ab05",
                                                "text": "In a statement, Khan called the deal a sticking plaster and said: \"The Government is, in effect, making ordinary Londoners pay the cost for doing the right thing on COVID-19."
